---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'September 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  description="Terms of use for shahzadakram.com."
>
  <section class="wrapper prose page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <p>
      These terms govern your use of shahzadakram.com (this site). By browsing or using this
      site, you agree to them. If you don't agree, please don't use the site.
    </p>

    <h2>The content</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">
      Articles, case studies, and guides on this site reflect my own opinions and experience.
      They're provided for general information only and shouldn't be taken as professional advice
      specific to your situation. Where figures, results, or case study data are shared, they
      describe outcomes for specific businesses under specific conditions — your results may
      differ.
    </p>

    <h2>No warranty</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">
      This site and its content are provided "as is", without warranties of any kind, express or
      implied. I make reasonable efforts to keep content accurate and up to date, but I don't
      guarantee it's complete, current, or error-free.
    </p>

    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">
      To the extent permitted by law, I'm not liable for any loss or damage arising from your use
      of this site or reliance on its content, including indirect or consequential loss.
    </p>

    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">
      Unless otherwise stated, the content on this site — text, case studies, graphics, and
      design — is my own work and protected by copyright. You're welcome to link to this site or
      quote short excerpts with attribution. Reproducing substantial portions of the content
      elsewhere without permission isn't allowed.
    </p>

    <h2>External links</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">
      This site links to third-party sites and services (for example, LinkedIn or client
      websites). I'm not responsible for the content, accuracy, or practices of those external
      sites.
    </p>

    <h2>The contact form and services enquiries</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">
      Submitting the contact form or enquiring about services doesn't create any contractual
      obligation on either side. Any paid engagement would be agreed separately, in writing,
      before work begins.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">
      These terms may be updated from time to time. Continued use of the site after changes are
      published means you accept the updated terms.
    </p>

    <h2>Governing law</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">
      These terms are governed by the laws of England and Wales.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">
      Questions about these terms? Email{' '}
      <a href="mailto:contact@shahzadakram.com">contact@shahzadakram.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page {
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .page h2 {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  .page h2:first-of-type {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
  }
</style>
